{
  "name": "Releases go one a tick in resolution order, a void is released like a resolution, and a parlay outlives its leg's release",
  "rules": ["E-8.4", "E-8.5", "E-7.12", "E-7.1", "E-15.7", "E-12.2", "E-12.6"],
  "notes": [
    "Event 101 is voided at t1 and event 100 resolved at t1 + 1 ms; neither has trades, so each emits only its outcome and market state (E-15.5).",
    "An hour later the default retention of 604 800 s (D-29) keeps both.",
    "SetListingParameters shortens the retention to 60 s. It applies to both events at the next tick (E-7.12), and both are now due, but a tick releases at most one event: first 101, resolved earliest, then 100, then nothing.",
    "The parlay 3000 names 1000 as its leg. Legs are the listing's data only, so releasing the leg's event leaves the parlay listed and open: A bids 10 at 5c (reservation 50).",
    "ExpireParlay settles event 300 at t9: A's bid is removed (MARKET_RESOLVED) and its 50 returned; no one holds a position, so there are no payouts.",
    "At t9 + 59.999 s the release is not due. At t9 + 60 s a resend of the expiry under its command ID is a DUPLICATE (E-7.1): commands never release, only ticks do.",
    "The tick at t9 + 60.001 s releases event 300. The command ID is still remembered (seven days, D-25), so the resend stays a DUPLICATE; a new ExpireParlay names an instrument that no longer exists and is INVALID_COMMAND (E-8.5).",
    "A cancel of A's old order on 3000 is UNKNOWN_ORDER, and a mass cancel of instrument 3000 has nothing in scope and emits nothing (E-12.6)."
  ],
  "setup": [
    {"op": "centTable", "tickTableId": 1},
    {"op": "binary", "eventId": 100, "instrumentId": 1000},
    {"op": "binary", "eventId": 101, "instrumentId": 1010},
    {"op": "parlay", "eventId": 300, "instrumentId": 3000, "legs": [{"legEventId": 100, "legInstrumentId": 1000, "legOutcome": "YES"}]},
    {"op": "fund", "accountId": 1, "cents": 10000}
  ],
  "steps": [
    {"input": {"msg": "ResolveEvent", "commandId": "q1", "eventId": 101, "kind": "VOID"},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "CommandApplied", "commandId": "q1", "outcome": "APPLIED"},
       {"msg": "MarketStateChanged", "instrumentId": 1010, "state": "VOIDED"}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "ResolveEvent", "commandId": "q2", "eventId": 100, "kind": "RESOLVED", "winningState": 1},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "CommandApplied", "commandId": "q2", "outcome": "APPLIED"},
       {"msg": "MarketStateChanged", "instrumentId": 1000, "state": "SETTLED"}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "TimeTick"}, "advanceNs": 3600000000000, "expect": []},
    {"input": {"msg": "SetListingParameters", "commandId": "p1", "settledRetentionSeconds": 60, "maxEvents": 0, "maxInstruments": 0, "maxPriceLevels": 0},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "CommandApplied", "commandId": "p1", "outcome": "APPLIED"}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "TimeTick"}, "expect": [{"msg": "EventReleased", "eventId": 101}]},
    {"input": {"msg": "TimeTick"}, "expect": [{"msg": "EventReleased", "eventId": 100}]},
    {"input": {"msg": "TimeTick"}, "expect": []},
    {"input": {"msg": "NewOrder", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a1", "instrumentId": 3000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 4, "quantity": 10},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderAccepted", "orderId": "O1", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "a1", "instrumentId": 3000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 4, "quantity": 10, "reservedCents": 50},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 9950, "reservedCents": 50},
       {"msg": "BookLevelChanged", "instrumentId": 3000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 4, "quantity": 10, "orderCount": 1}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "ExpireParlay", "commandId": "x1", "instrumentId": 3000, "causingEventId": 100},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "CommandApplied", "commandId": "x1", "outcome": "APPLIED"},
       {"msg": "OrderCancelled", "orderId": "O1", "accountId": 1, "instrumentId": 3000, "cancelledQuantity": 10, "reason": "MARKET_RESOLVED"},
       {"msg": "MarketStateChanged", "instrumentId": 3000, "state": "SETTLED"},
       {"msg": "SleeveChanged", "accountId": 1, "availableCents": 10000, "reservedCents": 0},
       {"msg": "BookLevelChanged", "instrumentId": 3000, "side": "BUY", "tick": 4, "quantity": 0, "orderCount": 0}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "TimeTick"}, "advanceNs": 59999000000, "expect": []},
    {"input": {"msg": "ExpireParlay", "commandId": "x1", "instrumentId": 3000, "causingEventId": 100},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "CommandApplied", "commandId": "x1", "outcome": "DUPLICATE"}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "TimeTick"}, "expect": [{"msg": "EventReleased", "eventId": 300}]},
    {"input": {"msg": "ExpireParlay", "commandId": "x1", "instrumentId": 3000, "causingEventId": 100},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "CommandApplied", "commandId": "x1", "outcome": "DUPLICATE"}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "ExpireParlay", "commandId": "x2", "instrumentId": 3000, "causingEventId": 100},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "CommandApplied", "commandId": "x2", "outcome": "REJECTED", "rejectReason": "INVALID_COMMAND"}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "CancelOrder", "accountId": 1, "instrumentId": 3000, "orderId": "O1"},
     "expect": [
       {"msg": "OrderRejected", "accountId": 1, "clientOrderId": "", "instrumentId": 3000, "reason": "UNKNOWN_ORDER"}
     ]},
    {"input": {"msg": "MassCancel", "accountId": 1, "scope": "INSTRUMENT", "scopeRef": 3000, "cause": "CLIENT_REQUEST"}, "expect": []}
  ]
}
